###1. GET All vehicles (show all)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Accept: application/json

###

###2. GET one vehicle by ID (read one)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Accept: application/json

###

###3. POST create a new vehicle (create one)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "3",
  "brand": "Hyundai",
  "model": "Ioniq 5",
  "registrationNumber": "CE7788EE",
  "fleetId": "1",
  "rentedByUserId": null
}

###

###4. PUT update an existing vehicle (update one)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "3",
  "brand": "Hyundai",
  "model": "Ioniq 6",
  "registrationNumber": "CE7788EE",
  "fleetId": "1",
  "rentedByUserId": "1"
}

###

###5. DELETE vehicle by ID (delete one)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Accept: application/json
